From 4dd02e7ef56364e25598538e77455f7e492de8da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:04:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): revoked-401 churn never types a quota reset;
 quota-release --probe refuses a confirmed wall [daveey]

A pool emptied by auth failures (401/revoked rows) raises SubscriptionAuthUnavailable: exit 75, receipt
quota_unconfirmed, a short capped backoff, and no quota_episode or provider wall. A start-time
SubscriptionQuotaUnavailable the live /api/oauth/usage read contradicts is booked as QuotaContradicted
(same unconfirmed path). `hermes kanban quota-release <id> --probe` releases only when the live usage
read shows headroom on every walled provider; otherwise it records an audited quota_release_refused.
---
